    "https://www.unh.edu/career/technology": {
      "title": "Career Technology",
      "description": "Career Technology | Career and Professional Success Skip to main content University of New Hampshire Search Menu Search UNH.edu Search Career and Professional Success Search UNH.edu Search Search Commonly Searched Items: Handshake Wildcat Connections Career Events Career and Professional Success Students Make an Appointment Resources Jobs and Careers for Students Internships Internship Funding Opportunities Applying to Grad School Reserve an Interview Room Employers Recruiting Opportunities Partnerships & Sponsorships Submit Recruiting Survey Handshake for Employers Explore Internship Resources Become a Work Study Site Hire a UNH Law Student Review Policies Career Technology Handshake for Students Workday On-Campus Employment Generative AI for Career Handshake for Volunteer Organizations Forage Career Events Career & Internship Fair Interview Days Industry-Specific Career Events Career Event Student Preparation Alumni Career Resources for Alumni Faculty & Staff Handshake for UNH Departments CaPS Information and Partnership Opportunities Faculty & Staff Employer Visit Request Resources for Advising Students About CaPS Meet the CaPS Team First Destination Survey Student Experience Survey Campus-2-Career In This Section Career Technology Handshake for Students Workday On-Campus Employment Generative AI for Career Handshake for Volunteer Organizations Forage Career Technology Career and Professional Success provides a number of platforms and career technology tools to assist students in building professional success. These tools are free and available 24/7 to all UNH students. Handshake Handshake is the online home for student and employer connection at UNH. Students and recent alumni (0-5 years experience) can search and apply for jobs and internships, volunteer opportunities, research employers, and much more. learn More Generative AI Students using artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support their career development can enhance job and internship searches, improve application materials, and offer career insights. learn More Vault Vault is a career research tool containing more than 80 career guides and employer profiles, continually updated \"insider\" information on over 3,000 companies and 70 industries including employee surveys on thousands of top employers, a collection of company-specific message boards for employees, and an extensive free job board with thousands of top job openings. Learn More LinkedIn Learning LinkedIn Learning is a powerful tool for building career readiness and lifelong professional growth. With thousands of expert-led courses across business, technology, and creative fields, students and professionals alike can develop in-demand skills, explore career paths, and stay competitive in today’s evolving job market. Whether you're preparing for internships, refining your resume, or mastering communication and leadership, LinkedIn Learning offers flexible, self-paced learning tailored to your goals. Start building your future today—one course at a time. Learn More (link to directions for USNH) Learn More Forage Forage is a career exploration and skill-building tool that connects education with career success. Through free, self-paced job simulations developed with leading companies, students can explore different career paths, preview real-world roles and tasks, and build practical skills they can apply in the workplace. Students can enroll in job simulations, complete hands-on activities, and earn certificates that can be added to their resume and LinkedIn profile. Learn More See a list of additional career websites, tools, and technology the Career and Professional Success Team recommends. additional Resources The Next Step Handshake Schedule an Appointment Reserve an Interview Room Hire a Wildcat CAPS by college College of Engineering and Physical Sciences College of Health and Human Services College of Liberal Arts College of Life Sciences and Agriculture College of Professional Studies Paul College of Business and Economics Copyright © 2026, University of New Hampshire. All rights reserved. TTY Users: 7-1-1 or 800-735-2964 (Relay NH) USNH Privacy Policies  • USNH Terms of Use  • Accessibility  • Statement of Nondiscrimination  • Jeanne Clery Act Contact Us Career and Professional Success Hood House 89 Main St. Durham, NH 03824 (603) 862-2070 caps@unh.edu @UNHCaPs Like us on Facebook Follow us on Twitter Follow us on LinkedIn Follow us on Instagram Career and Professional Success Students Show Students submenu Make an Appointment Resources Show Resources submenu Resumes Cover Letters References and Thank You Notes DIY Professional Headshot Photo Booth Campus Involvement Interview Skills Networking Show Networking submenu Informational Interviews Wildcat Way to Professional Success Your Pitch Workplace Safety Additional Resources Jobs and Careers for Students Internships Internship Funding Opportunities Applying to Grad School Reserve an Interview Room Employers Show Employers submenu Recruiting Opportunities Partnerships & Sponsorships Submit Recruiting Survey Handshake for Employers Explore Internship Resources Become a Work Study Site Hire a UNH Law Student Review Policies Career Technology Hide Career Technology submenu Handshake for Students Workday On-Campus Employment Generative AI for Career Handshake for Volunteer Organizations Forage Career Events Show Career Events submenu Career & Internship Fair Show Career & Internship Fair submenu Employer Details Show Employer Details submenu Sponsorship Interview Days Industry-Specific Career Events Career Event Student Preparation Alumni Show Alumni submenu Career Resources for Alumni Faculty & Staff Show Faculty & Staff submenu Handshake for UNH Departments CaPS Information and Partnership Opportunities Faculty & Staff Employer Visit Request Resources for Advising Students About CaPS Show About CaPS submenu Meet the CaPS Team First Destination Survey Student Experience Survey Campus-2-Car