    "https://manchester.unh.edu/student-experience/clubs-organizations": {
      "title": "Clubs & Organizations",
      "description": "Clubs & Organizations | UNH Manchester Skip to main content This site uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. By continuing to use this site, you agree to the use of cookies, in accordance with the USNH website Privacy Policy. OK ✓ University of New Hampshire Search Menu Search UNH.edu Search UNH Manchester Search UNH.edu Search Search Commonly Searched Items: Academic Calendar Visit Tuition Registrar UNH Manchester Academics Programs of Study Graduate Programs Academic Advising Academic Support Academic Calendar Course Schedule Millyard Scholars Program Registration Office Departments Non-Degree Students Admissions How to Apply First-Year Students Transfer Students International Students Graduate Students Military & Veteran Students Financial Aid Tuition & Costs Scholarships Campus Tours & Events Accepted Students Careers Career and Professional Success Work-Based Learning Handshake Career Technology For Employers Wildcat Way to Professional Success Research Biotechnology Innovation Center Library NASA STEM on Station Undergraduate Research Winter Symposium Student Experience About Our City Assistant Dean of Student Success Campus Safety Commencement Clubs & Organizations Current Students Diversity & Inclusion Housing & Dining Student Wellness Student and Community Engagement Wildcats at the YMCA Basic Needs Support About Contact Us Directions & Parking Faculty & Staff Resources Leadership People Technology Blog Alumni Outreach STEM Discovery Lab Manchester CREATES STEM-MoBILE Student Experience Clubs & Organizations In This Section Student Experience About Our City Assistant Dean of Student Success Campus Safety Commencement Clubs & Organizations Current Students Diversity & Inclusion Housing & Dining Student Wellness Student and Community Engagement Wildcats at the YMCA Basic Needs Support Clubs & Organizations Whether you're interested in academics, culture, or service, there's a club for you. If you have a unique interest or idea to share, you can start your own club! There are many resources available to help you get involved. Need help finding ways to engage on campus? Contact Ally.Twitchell@unh.edu . Start a Club It’s easy to start your own club on the UNH Manchester campus – all you need is the following: A unique idea that positively contributes to the UNHM campus Yourself and 2 other students A faculty or staff advisor If you're ready for the commitment of club leadership, simply click the link below to complete the Organization Registration form and review the current club policies. Club Recognition form Your submission will be reviewed by the Office of Student and Community Engagement. If your club is approved, you will be contacted to set up an Introductory Meeting. Quicklinks Programs of Study First Year Applicants Graduate Students Transfer Students International Students Veterans & Non-Traditional Stop Campus Hazing Act More to Explore Academics Clery Report Emergency Procedures Program Consumer Information Event Calendar Faculty & Staff Resources Incident Report Form Copyright © 2026, University of New Hampshire. All rights reserved. TTY Users: 7-1-1 or 800-735-2964 (Relay NH) USNH Privacy Policies  • USNH Terms of Use  • Accessibility  • Statement of Nondiscrimination  • Jeanne Clery Act Contact Us UNH Manchester 88 Commercial Street Manchester, NH 03101 (603) 641-4101 +1 (603) 641-4304 UNH Manchester Academics Show Academics submenu Programs of Study Graduate Programs Academic Advising Show Academic Advising submenu Advising Appointments Advising Forms Foundations of Success Track Frequently Asked Questions Graduate Student Advising New Students Study Abroad & Away Parents and Families Show Parents and Families submenu Curriculum and Policy for Parents Navigating the Transition to College: A Timeline Parent and Family FAQ Academic Support Academic Calendar Course Schedule Millyard Scholars Program Registration Office Show Registration Office submenu Course Delivery Modality G